### What I saw

`generate --inputs-json FILE --edit IMG` drops the edit image and is refused ("requires image_ref"): `--inputs-json` replaces the CLI inputs instead of merging with them. Duplicate CLI and JSON keys are deliberately rejected (`tests/core/generation/test_entry_cli_contract.py:146`). Not checked whether the edit-admission fix (T1, `3ea7381d`) changed this. A small fix once the merge rule is chosen.

Source: Usability log, batch 6 (bug) (interim file `observations/2026-11-12-inputs-json-replaces-cli-inputs.md`, 2026-11-12)

